      "content": "thanks, but that's more like a set of instructions than an actual draft. i need the actual words the employee would send to the customer. \n\ncan you give me the full response? remember, it needs to be professional but we really want to see that positivity index climb so we can use it as a benchmark for the team. try to make it as positive as possible while still being a real email. i'll check it against the tool once you're done.",
